        <activityName xml:lang="en">Treatment of fuel cell stack, 1MWe, SOEC</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Treatment of fuel cell stack, 1MWe, SOEC
1 MW SOEC electrolyzer stack end of life treatment, based on Niklas Gerloff, Comparative Life-Cycle-Assessment analysis of three major water electrolysis technologies while applying various energy scenarios for a greener hydrogen production, Journal of Energy Storage, Volume 43, 2021, https://doi.org/10.1/j.est0.20.1. For further secifications (e.g., efficiency, lifetime, etc.), refer to Sacchi, R. and Bauer, C. LCA of Power-to-X processes and applications in the residential sector. Paul Scherrer Institut, 2023.

